'''Chroma Swirly Gun''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] gun that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2021 Christmas Box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2021|2021 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.  

==Appearance==
It appears to resemble the look of a mini revolver with a Christmas look to it. It has a candy cane pattern on the handle, a little peppermint beside the trigger, a small blade below the barrel, and two straps around the barrel, all alternating in color over time, excluding the silver parts.

==Trivia==   
*It is the chroma counterpart of the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun under the name [[Swirly Gun]], which was found in the same box.
*It was a victim of mass [[duping]], causing it to lose a lot of value. In fact, for some time, its [[Swirly Gun|regular counterpart]] was worth more. 
*It is the fourth holiday chroma and the second Christmas chroma to be released inside the game, the others being [[Chroma Evergreen]], [[Chroma Evergun]], [[Chroma Cookiecane]] and [[Chroma Gingerblade]].
* This is the first holiday chroma gun to be released.
*Like all the other [[Chroma Weapons]], it is not salvageable in the crafting station.

